stateDiagram-v2
    state "New (chưa có row StudyPlaceProgress hoặc attempts = 0)" as New
    state "Started (attempts > 0, repetition < 2, masteredAt null)" as Started
    state "Learning (repetition >= 2, masteredAt null)" as Learning
    state "Mastered (masteredAt khác null)" as Mastered

    [*] --> New: user mở StudyPlace lần đầu

    New --> Started: review lần đầu (upsert create) - mọi quality
    Started --> Started: quality <= 2 (lapse, repetition về 0) hoặc quality >= 3 khi repetition mới = 1
    Started --> Learning: quality >= 3 lần nữa (repetition đạt 2)
    Learning --> Learning: quality = 3 (repetition tăng nhưng chưa mastered) hoặc quality >= 4 khi repetition < 4
    Learning --> Started: quality <= 2 (lapse, repetition về 0)
    Learning --> Mastered: quality >= 4 và repetition >= 4 (set masteredAt)
    Mastered --> Mastered: ôn lại quality >= 4 (masteredAt set lại)
    Mastered --> Learning: ôn lại quality = 3 (masteredAt về null, repetition vẫn >= 2)
    Mastered --> Started: ôn lại quality <= 2 (lapse, repetition về 0, masteredAt về null)

    New --> [*]: resetStudyPlaceProgressAction deleteMany
    Started --> New: reset (deleteMany row)
    Learning --> New: reset (deleteMany row)
    Mastered --> New: reset (deleteMany row)

    note right of Started
        Lịch ôn nextReviewAt theo SM-2 rút gọn
        quality <= 1 - ôn lại sau 20 phút
        quality = 2 - interval 1 ngày
        quality >= 3 - interval 1-2, 3-6 ngày rồi nhân easeFactor (tối đa 365 ngày)
    end note

